    "text": "Houston\nGuardians complete three-game sweep of Astros with 4-2 win behind Jose Ramirez and Slade Cecconi\nBy Paul Hoynes, cleveland.com,\n2 hours agoHOUSTON — If Jose Ramirez isn’t the best player on two feet, he may be the best on one. A couple hours after telling reporters on Wednesday that he was withdrawing from his starting gig at third base for the American League All-Stars because of a sore right ankle, Ramirez led the Guardians to a three-game sweep of the Astros with a 4-2 win at Daikin Park.",
